# Third-party APKs analysed for behaviour, and the notes written about them. Held
# locally on purpose: a commercial build must not be redistributed from this
# repository, and the notes are research material, not part of the distribution.
research/

# Locally downloaded CI artefacts. An APK is a build output, never a source file.
out/

# Working notes kept on this machine only. They are the project's memory, not
# documentation for the repository: they record half-verified findings and device
# details that do not belong in a public tree.
memory.md
